9-10 Sanskrit</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>All over the world, human beings create an immense and ever-increasing volume of data, with new kinds of data regularly...</p>\n\n<a class=\"btn-read\" href=\"#\">apply now</a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./courses-box--></div>\n\n<!--./col-md-12-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\n<div class=\"courses-box\">\n\n<div class=\"courses-box-img\"><img src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/courseimg3.jpg\" /></div>\n\n<!--./courses-box-img-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"course-inner\">Hindi\n\n<h4>Class 9-10 Hindi</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>All over the world, human beings create an immense and ever-increasing volume of data, with new kinds of data regularly...</p>\n\n<a class=\"btn-read\" href=\"#\">apply now</a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./courses-box--></div>\n\n<!--./col-md-12-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\n<div class=\"courses-box\">\n\n<div class=\"courses-box-img\"><img src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/courseimg4.jpg\" /></div>\n\n<!--./courses-box-img-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"course-inner\"><a class=\"course-subject\" href=\"#\">Science</a>\n\n\n\n<h4>Electrical Engineering</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>All over the world, human beings create an immense and ever-increasing volume of data, with new kinds of data regularly...</p>\n\n<a class=\"btn-read\" href=\"#\">apply now</a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./courses-box--></div>\n\n<!--./col-md-12--></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./courses-carousel--></div>\n\n<!--./row--></div>\n\n<!--./container--></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"countdown_bg fullwidth counter\">\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"counter-content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"counter-title mt0\">ACHEIVEMENTS</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"counter-text\">\n\n<p>A wonderful serenity has taken possession of my entire soul, like these sweet mornings of spring which I enjoy with my whole heart like mine.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"counter-img\">\n\n<div class=\"about_img\"><img class=\"img-responsive img-rounded\" src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/achivement.jpg\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./col-md-6-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"counter-main\"><img class=\"svg\" src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/cap.svg\" />\n\n<h3 class=\"counter-value\" data-count=\"1000\">1000</h3>\n\n<span>Graduates</span></div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"counter-main\"><img class=\"svg\" src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/award.svg\" />\n\n<h3 class=\"counter-value\" data-count=\"500\">500</h3>\n\n<span>Certified Teachers</span></div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"counter-main\"><img class=\"svg\" src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/building-o.svg\" />\n\n<h3 class=\"counter-value\" data-count=\"100\">100</h3>\n\n<span>Student Campuses</span></div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-sm-6\">\n\n<div class=\"counter-main\"><img class=\"svg\" src=\"https://demo.smart-school.in/uploads/gallery/media/people.svg\" />\n\n<h3 class=\"counter-value\" data-count=\"6285\">6285</h3>\n\n<span>Students</span></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./col-md-6--></div>\n\n<!--./row--></div>\n\n<!--./col-md-6--></div>\n\n<!--./row--></div>\n\n<!--./container--></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"spaceb40 spacet40\">\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n\n<div class=\"col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-md-offset-2 text-center\">\n\n<h2 class=\"head-title\">PRINCIPAL / STAFFS</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Considering desire as primary motivation for the generation of narratives is a useful concept.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"divider\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--./col-md-8-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"teamstaff\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n\n<div class=\"owl