(1, 0, 0, 'Online', 'Re: Organic traffic with SEO service', 'Nitin Chaudhary', 'nitin.chaudhary@rankinghattechie.com', '', '', 0, '2024-04-05', '', '', 'Hello svnjagiroad.in Team,\n\n\n\nI would like to talk about your website SEO!\n\n\n\nI can assist you in gaining more leads and sales from your website and getting it to appear on Google\'s top page. \n\n\n\nCould I email you the price list and quote? \n\n\n\nThanks,\n\nNitin Chaudhary\n\nInternational SEO Project Manager\n\nEmail:- rankinghat9@gmail.com\n\nContact Number:- +1- (209) 813-5119\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you don’t want me to contact you again about this, reply with “opt-out” (Sent from online front site)', '', '', '2024-04-05 13:56:52'),
(2, 0, 0, 'Online', 'Re: Pay attention to Google’s guidelines - SEO settings', 'Kush', 'digitalxplode1@gmail.com', '', '', 0, '2024-04-09', '', '', 'Hi svnjagiroad.in,\n\n\n\nI hope you are doing great!\n\n\n\nI was going through your website on behalf of this email. It has a good design and it looks great, but it’s not ranking in top on Google and other major search engines.\n\n\n\nI’m an SEO Expert and I helped over 250 businesses rank on the (1st Page on Google). My rates are very affordable.\n\n\n\nLet me know if you are interested, then I can send you our SEO Packages and Price list.\n\n\n\nThanks & Regards,\n\nKush S\n\nSr SEO consultant\n\nPh. No: 1 469-663-1569\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you don’t want me to contact you again about this, reply with “opt-out”\n\n\n\n\n\n (Sent from online front site)', '', '', '2024-04-09 22:49:32'),
(3, 0, 0, 'Online', 'Could we talk soon?', 'Winston', 'redfordwinston54@gmail.com', '', '', 0, '2024-04-18', '', '', 'Winston here from Iowa. I\'m always watching to see what newer sites are going up and I just wanted to see if you would like an extra hand with getting some targeted traffic, create videos/images/adcopy, remove negative listings, the list goes on.  I\'ll even shoulder 90% of the costs, dedicating my time and tools that I\'ve created myself and bought over the years.  I\'ve been doing this for over 22 years, helped thousands of people and have loved every minute of it.\n\n\n\nThere\'s virtually no cost on my end to do any of this for you except for my time starting at 99 a month. I don\'t mean to impose; I was just curious if I could lend a hand.  \n\n\n\nBrief history, I\'ve been working from home for a couple decades now and I love helping others.  I\'m married, have three girls and if I can provide for them by helping you and giving back by using the tools and knowledge I\'ve built and learned over the years, I can\'t think of a better win-win.\n\n\n\nIt amazes me that no one else is helping others quite like I do and I\'d love to show you how I can help out.  So, if you need any extra help in any way, please let me know either way as I value your time and don\'t want to pester you.\n\n\n\nPS – If I didn’t mention something you might need help with just ask, I only mentioned a handful of things to keep this brief :-)\n\n\n\n\n\nAll the best,\n\n\n\nWinston\n\nCell - 1-319-435-1790‬\n\nMy Site (w/Live Chat) - https://cutt.ly/ww91SRIU\n\n (Sent from online front site)', '', '', '2024-04-18 01:24:17'),
(4, 0, 0, 'Online', 'Re: Quick question about website optimization', 'Georgia Smith', 'georgia@getonglobe.com', '', '', 0, '2024-04-26', '', '', 'Hi [svnjagiroad.in],\n\n\n\nI was checking your website and find out you have a good design and it looks great, but it’s not ranking on Google and other major search engines.\n\n \n\nWe can place your website on Google\'s 1st page. Yahoo, Facebook, LinkedIn, YouTube, Instagram, Pinterest etc.).\n\n \n\nLet me know if you are interested, then I can send our Packages and Pricelist.\n\n \n\nThank you,\n\nGeorgia - (Sr SEO consultant)\n\nwww.GetOnGlobe.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNote: - If you’re not Interested in our Services, please send us \"unsubscribe\" (Sent from online front site)', '', '', '2024-04-26 10:16:13'),
(5, 0, 0, 'Online', 'Re: Improve your website traffic and SEO', 'Mani T', 'info@myseoranks.com', '', '', 0, '2024-05-05', '', '', 'Hello team,\n\n\n\nsvnjagiroad.in\n\n\n\nI was surfing through your website and realized that despite having a great design; it was not ranking on any of the search engines (Google Yahoo and Bing) for most of the keywords relating to your business.\n\n\n\nWe offer your website top 10 ranking/Best results SEO & SMO Services within very short span of time at very reasonable cost. \n\n\n\nLet me know if you are interested, I will send you our SEO Packages and price list.\n\n\n\nThanks!\n\nMani T | Sr SEO consultant\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n If you\'re not Interested in our Services, please send us \"unsubscribe\".\n\n (Sent from online front site)', '', '', '2024-05-05 06:59:09');
